WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.531 --> 00:00:02.750
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Would you <b>like</b> to <b>go</b> to <b>Australia</b>?

2
00:00:05.323 --> 00:00:06.850
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, I <b>wouldn’t</b>.

3
00:00:08.507 --> 00:00:09.600
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> <b>Why not</b>?

4
00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:14.183
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> <b>Because</b> I <b>don’t like snakes</b> or <b>insects</b>.